Description:
CREATE TABLE t0(c0 INT, c1 INT);
INSERT INTO t0(c1, c0) VALUES(0, 1);

SELECT * FROM t0 WHERE t0.c1 IN (GREATEST(0.1, 0.2)); -- empty result
CREATE INDEX i0 ON t0(c1);
SELECT * FROM t0 WHERE t0.c1 IN (GREATEST(0.1, 0.2)); -- {1|0}

The same query returns different results with and without the index i0.

How to repeat:
docker run -it -p 3306:3306 -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=root mysql:8.2.0

Then execute the above test case.

Description:
The Query #2 should return nothing insteand of 0 because t0 = 0 > - 0.8.

**Query #1**
select * from t0;

| c0  |
| --- |
| 0   |

**Query #2**

SELECT t0.c0 FROM t0 WHERE t0.c0 <= - 0.8;

| c0  |
| --- |
| 0   |

**Query #3**

SELECT (t0.c0 <= - 0.8) IS TRUE AS flag FROM t0;

| flag |
| ---- |
| 0    |

How to repeat:
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS t0(c0 DECIMAL);
REPLACE INTO t0(c0) VALUES(0.1);

SELECT t0.c0 FROM t0 WHERE t0.c0 <= - 0.8;

SELECT (t0.c0 <= - 0.8) IS TRUE AS flag FROM t0;

Suggested fix:
The Query #2 should return nothing instead of 0;
